@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

@startuml
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    ActorBorderColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontName "Consolas"
    ParticipantFontSize 13

    NoteBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
    NoteBorderColor #F1C40F
}

actor User
participant Context as "ClassPathXml\nApplicationContext"
participant Reader as "XmlBeanDefinition\nReader"
participant Factory as "DefaultListable\nBeanFactory"
participant Configurer as "CustomEditor\nConfigurer"
participant BW as "BeanWrapperImpl"
participant Editor as "AddressPropertyEditor\n(自定义)" #D5F5E3
participant Pojo as "Customer Bean"

autonumber

== 阶段一：资源定位与解析 (Loading & Parsing) ==

User -> Context: new ClassPathXmlApplicationContext("beans.xml")
activate Context
Context -> Context: <b>refresh()</b>

Context -> Factory: obtainFreshBeanFactory()
activate Factory
Factory -> Reader: <b>loadBeanDefinitions(xml)</b>
activate Reader

note right of Reader
  <b>1. 读取 XML 文件</b>
  解析 <bean id="customer">...
  解析 <bean class="CustomEditorConfigurer">...
  将它们封装为 <b>BeanDefinition</b> 对象
  (此时并未创建 Customer 对象，只是存了定义)
end note

Reader -> Factory: registerBeanDefinition()
deactivate Reader
deactivate Factory

== 阶段二：应用扩展配置 (Registration) ==
note right of Context
  <b><color:Red>【关键扩展点入口】</color></b>
  Spring 发现 XML 里定义了一个
  BeanFactoryPostProcessor (即 CustomEditorConfigurer)
  会优先执行它
end note

Context -> Context: invokeBeanFactoryPostProcessors()

Context -> Configurer: <b>postProcessBeanFactory(factory)</b>
activate Configurer

Configurer -> Factory: <b>registerCustomEditor</b>(Address.class, AddressPropertyEditor)
note right of Factory
  <b>注册动作：</b>
  Factory 内部维护了一个 Map<Class, Class>
  记录了 Address -> AddressPropertyEditor 的映射关系
  供后续使用
end note

deactivate Configurer

== 阶段三：Bean 实例化与属性填充 (Instantiation) ==

Context -> Context: finishBeanFactoryInitialization()
Context -> Factory: <b>getBean("customer")</b>
activate Factory

Factory -> Factory: createBean() -> doCreateBean()

' 1. 实例化
Factory -> Factory: createBeanInstance()
note right: Customer 对象被 new 出来 (属性全为 null)

' 2. 填充属性
Factory -> Factory: <b>populateBean()</b>
note right: 读取 BeanDefinition 中的 PropertyValues\n(name="address", value="广东省_...")

Factory -> BW: <b>setPropertyValues()</b>
activate BW

loop 属性赋值
    BW -> BW: setPropertyValue()
    note right of BW: 发现目标类型 Address 与源类型 String 不匹配

    BW -> Factory: getCustomEditor(Address.class)
    Factory --> BW: 返回 <b>AddressPropertyEditor</b> (阶段二注册的)

    BW -> Editor: <b>setAsText("广东省_...")</b>
    activate Editor #D5F5E3
    note right of Editor: <b><color:Red>【扩展点核心逻辑】</color></b>\n执行 split 和 new Address()
    Editor --> BW: void
    deactivate Editor

    BW -> Editor: <b>getValue()</b>
    activate Editor #D5F5E3
    return Address Object

    BW -> Pojo: <b>setAddress(object)</b>
    activate Pojo
    return
end

deactivate BW
return Customer Bean (Ready)

deactivate Context

@enduml